      "Use a bounded synchronous interaction when the immediate response genuinely needs the dependency's answer. Use asynchronous messaging when completion can be decoupled and delayed processing is acceptable. Messaging adds delivery, ordering, retry, and operational concerns; it is not automatically simpler. State the consistency requirement and user-visible pending behavior before choosing the transport.",
