      "ROW_NUMBER assigns a separate sequence number to each row. RANK gives ties the same rank and leaves gaps; DENSE_RANK gives ties the same rank without gaps. Use a deterministic tie-breaker for row selection. Do not add a unique ID to the ranking order when the intent is to preserve equal salaries as ties.",
