      "Test boundaries",
      "Which tests would you use for a service that calculates totals and writes through EF?",
      "Unit-test pure pricing rules with deterministic inputs and test the database integration against a representative database provider. Add a small number of end-to-end checks for critical user journeys. Mocking every EF behavior can miss query translation, constraints, and transaction differences. Pick each test's boundary based on the failure it must detect, not a universal test-count ratio.",
